title: "RECTIFY: RNA 5' and 3' End Correction Framework"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the methods paper below
  (Roy & Chanfreau 2020). A dedicated RECTIFY manuscript is in
  preparation; this entry will be updated when it is released.
